        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Early in the morning, we arrange a transfer with a driver from your hotel to Foz do Iguaçu airport. You then fly to Manaus via São Paulo. On arrival, the lodge’s shared transfer service meets you and takes you to Amazon Ecopark Jungle Lodge."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:de12fc308ef1a094",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5f9838c167ec29b6debd6a7e2377f11b2b1a5508f7a2de2fd51a9ef592640bb9",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "The trip includes a 2-day, 1-night stay at Amazon Ecopark Jungle Lodge on its Standard Package. After visiting the cities and Iguazu, you spend this part of your journey in the Amazon. We confirm the activities with the lodge while planning your trip."
    },
